== Development approach ==

Pɪxᴇʟ's technical background informs their approach to VRChat-related software and community infrastructure.

Priorities include maintainable tools, clear administrative permissions, useful audit information and reducing repetitive work for community teams.

Privacy, responsible access and platform rules are considerations throughout development. Automation is intended to support authorised administration rather than bypass permissions or replace human judgement.

Experimental projects are described according to their development stage. Planned functionality and research objectives should not be treated as released features or verified capabilities.

